// Refused: Aetheris has no sweep of a solid and no union. The solid is a convex polyhedron of
// twelve faces, but Firmament makes polyhedra only by extruding or lofting a profile, or as the
// regular Polyhedron<N>, and this one is none of those: each end is three faces of the box.
